# size 20x5
# A resize, which the corpus could not express until now.
#
# Every line here is short enough not to wrap, deliberately. tmux does not reflow and this emulator
# does, so a case with a wrapped line in it would be asking two terminals a question they answer
# differently by design. What is being compared is everything else a resize touches: which content
# survives, where the cursor lands, and what the screen is afterwards.
\e[H\e[2Jalpha\r\nbravo\r\ncharlie\r\ndelta
# resize 10x3
\e[3;1Hafter
